{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 85,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "85:1",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By the sky containing great stars",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:2",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And [by] the promised Day",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:3",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And [by] the witness and what is witnessed,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:4",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Destroyed [i.e., cursed] were the companions of the trench",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:5",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "[Containing] the fire full of fuel,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:6",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "When they were sitting near it.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:7",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And they, to what they were doing against the believers, were witnesses.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:8",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And they resented them not except because they believed in Allāh, the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:9",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allāh, over all things, is Witness.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:10",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:11",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:12",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "Indeed, the assault [i.e., vengeance] of your Lord is severe.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:13",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "Indeed, it is He who originates [creation] and repeats.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:14",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And He is the Forgiving, the Affectionate,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:15",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "Honorable Owner of the Throne,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:16",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "Effecter of what He intends.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:17",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Has there reached you the story of the soldiers -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:18",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "[Those of] Pharaoh and Thamūd?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:19",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "But they who disbelieve are in [persistent] denial,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:20",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "While Allāh encompasses them from behind.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:21",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "But this is an honored Qur’ān",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "85:22",
      "surahNumber": 85,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "[Inscribed] in a Preserved Slate.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
